<title>USA: Qwest extends exchange offer.</title>
<headline>Qwest extends exchange offer.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Qwest Communications International Inc said Monday it has extended its offer to exchange its 10-7/8 percent Series B Senior Notes Due 2007 for its 10-7/8 percent Senior Notes Due 2007.</p>
<p>The offer has been extended until 1700 EDT on August 21. It previously had been scheduled to expire at 1700 EDT on August 18.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
